            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I'll leave someone else to do that work. Solution works fine for me. Seems you'd rather me have to deal with an unnecessary error that pops up most of the time for no good reason. You could add the pcall and log the issue as I mentioned. That would be the optional solution rather than force me to deal with the problem since you don't want to. I'm not going to try to track down which plugin or where the issue comes from. Maybe improve the error message for the autocmd * errors rather than just telling me there was an error and giving me least informative error message possible.",
